{"id":"9e93b2477e743baa","group":"93","path":"93/93-cor-compactness-variant.md","title":"Compactness Variant","display":"Compactness Variant","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-cor-compactness-variant","aliases":["93-cor-compactness-variant"],"display":"Compactness Variant","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-compactness]]","[[93-thm-compactness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-cor-compactness-variant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-cor-compactness-variant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Compactness Variant"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d\" href=\"?note=f3b6daa28ddd9b5d\" title=\"93-df-compactness\">93-df-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b41e0f05a0c07f8d\" href=\"?note=b41e0f05a0c07f8d\" title=\"93-thm-compactness\">93-thm-compactness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-compactness-variant---Compactness-Variant\">cor-compactness-variant - Compactness Variant</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a formula carrier and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}\\)</span> is the finitarity predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d\" href=\"?note=f3b6daa28ddd9b5d\" title=\"93-df-compactness\">93-df-compactness</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The implication follows because finitarity is one of the clauses in the book's definition of a logic. It does not assert compactness for an arbitrary untyped binary relation.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-compactness-variant---Compactness-Variant","text":"cor-compactness-variant - Compactness Variant","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"b41e0f05a0c07f8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-thm-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}$ is the finitarity predicate of [[93-df-compactness]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)","display":true}],"bytes":815,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["bd7e4207897c8db3","f3b6daa28ddd9b5d","b41e0f05a0c07f8d"]}